OL,14,CG2025FHacker T. Dog becomes a regular
OL,15,Fmember of the Blue Peter (CBBC)
OL,16,Fpresenting team. He previously appeared
OL,17,Fas a guest presenter. He's the
OL,18,Fprogramme's second puppet presenter -
OL,19,FBasil Brush joined the presenting team
OL,20,Fin January 2003.
